{"term":"Eierlecker","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"compound_sexual_insult","concept":"cocksucker_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":65,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":55,"recognition_pct_peak":55,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'ball-licker' (Eier = eggs/testicles, lecker = licker); a compound insult for a contemptible, servile, or sycophantic person.","english_term":"ball-licker","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Eier' (eggs) is ubiquitous German slang for testicles; the insult maps functionally to 'ass-kisser' in its servility connotation but deploys explicitly oral-genital imagery instead of the anal euphemism."}
{"term":"Klotenfresser","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"compound_sexual_insult","concept":"cocksucker_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":82,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":30,"recognition_pct_peak":30,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'ball-muncher' (Kloten = testicles, Fresser = glutton/eater); an extremely crude compound insult for a despicable or contemptible person.","english_term":"ball-muncher","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Kloten' is primarily Alemannic/Swiss German dialect for testicles (also the name of a municipality near Zürich Airport); the '-fresser' suffix (from fressen, animal-style eating) is a highly productive crude intensifier implying bestial excess."}
{"term":"Mosenküsser","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"cunnilingus_derived_insult","concept":"cocksucker_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":72,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":42,"recognition_pct_peak":42,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'pussy-kisser' (Mose/Möse = vulva, Küsser = kisser); a crude compound insult implying servility or contemptibility, derived from the act of cunnilingus.","english_term":"pussy-kisser","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Möse' is standard crude German slang for the vulva; the insult parallels English 'ass-kisser' in its sycophancy register but substitutes an explicit vulvar referent for the anal euphemism."}
{"term":"Pornosau","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"sexual_excess_insult","concept":"sexual_excess_crude","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":74,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":62,"recognition_pct_peak":62,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'porn pig/sow' (Porno = pornography, Sau = pig/sow); a crude compound insult for a person degradingly obsessed with pornography or sexual excess.","english_term":"porn pig","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Sau' (sow) is one of the most productive German insult suffixes, implying wallowing, dirtiness, and moral degradation; productive in compounds such as 'Drecksau,' 'Arschlochsau,' etc.; the Porno- prefix narrows the excess specifically to pornographic consumption."}
{"term":"Pornoschnurrbart","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"pornographic_appearance_insult","concept":"sleaze","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_neutral","crude":38,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":72,"recognition_pct_peak":72,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'porn mustache'; the stereotypical thick, bushy mustache associated with 1970s–80s male pornographic actors; used descriptively or as an insult implying a sleazy, pornographic aesthetic.","english_term":"pornstache","english_translation_quality":"direct","notes":"A near-calque of the English 'pornstache'; mild on the crude scale because it targets physical appearance rather than sexual behavior directly; recognized across generations as cultural shorthand for retro-sleazy male presentation."}
{"term":"Ficklöffel","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"compound_sexual_insult","concept":"fucker_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":76,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":38,"recognition_pct_peak":38,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'fuck-spoon' (Fick = fuck, Löffel = spoon); a nonsensical but crude compound insult for a contemptible idiot or deeply annoying person.","english_term":"fucking idiot","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"The '-löffel' (spoon) suffix is semantically arbitrary — it functions as a comic intensifier rather than contributing literal meaning; German's compounding morphology enables such creative nonsense-compounds freely, and the absurdity can itself amplify the insult's dismissiveness."}
{"term":"Fickfehler","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"unwanted_conception_insult","concept":"bastard_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":88,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":60,"recognition_pct_peak":60,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'fuck-mistake' (Fick = fuck, Fehler = mistake/error); an extremely cruel insult for an unwanted or accidentally conceived child, or broadly for any worthless, contemptible person.","english_term":"fucking mistake","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"The primary and most cutting sense is 'accidental conception' — an unwanted child — making it one of the more savage German insults because it attacks a person's right to exist; secondarily used as a generic crude insult stripped of the birth-origin implication."}
{"term":"Wichserkanal","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"masturbation_derived_insult","concept":"fucker_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":76,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":32,"recognition_pct_peak":32,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'wanker-canal' (Wichser = wanker/masturbator, Kanal = canal/channel); a crude compound insult for a pathetically contemptible person conceived as a conduit for masturbatory waste.","english_term":"wanker","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Wichser' alone is already a strong stand-alone insult equivalent to British 'wanker'; appending '-kanal' adds an anatomical dimension — implying the person is essentially a bodily duct for semen — while in internet-native usage it may additionally evoke a sleazy YouTube 'channel' run by a wanker."}
{"term":"Spermarochen","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"semen_creature_compound_insult","concept":"fucker_insult","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":87,"technical":12,"recognition_pct_current":18,"recognition_pct_peak":18,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'sperm ray' (Sperma = semen, Rochen = manta/stingray); a hyper-creative compound insult evoking a flat, bottom-dwelling aquatic creature wallowing in semen; used as an extremely crude general-purpose insult.","english_term":"sperm-soaked creep","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"An inventive confection typical of German's productive nominal compounding; the ray fish (Rochen) contributes associations of bottom-dwelling flatness and silent predation alongside the semen imagery; technical score nudged above zero because 'Sperma' retains its clinical register even in crude compounds; low recognition reflects creative invention over established slang circulation."}
{"term":"Sahnegesicht","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"insults","subcategory":"facial_ejaculation_insult","concept":"facial_ejaculation","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":88,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":48,"recognition_pct_peak":48,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Literally 'cream face' (Sahne = cream, a standard euphemism for semen; Gesicht = face); refers to a person who has received a facial ejaculation, or is deployed as a crude insult for a despicable person.","english_term":"cum face","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Sahne' (cream) is a well-established German sexual euphemism for semen, appearing in compounds such as 'Sahneschnitte'; the term functions both as a literal pornographic descriptor of the act/result and as a generalized crude insult whose sexual referent may be only dimly felt by casual users."}
